# OpenCode's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-opencode-setting-cookie = Your opencode.ai session. Sign in at https://opencode.ai/auth, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies > https://opencode.ai, and copy the auth and __Host-console_session cookies (either one alone also works). Paste them as "auth=value; __Host-console_session=value".
usage-opencode-setting-workspace-id = Optional. The workspace to read, as a wrk_... ID or the https://opencode.ai/workspace/... URL of its dashboard. Defaults to the first workspace of the account.
